=10 July 2021|archive-date=9 July 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210709161733/https://www.billboard.com/articles/columns/pop/9598592/the-kid-laroi-justin-bieber-stay-single-music-video|url-status=live}}</ref> The song reaches its climax as Laroi and Bieber's voices join in the last chorus.<ref name="RS">{{cite magazine|url=https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/justin-bieber-the-kid-laroi-stay-video-1194847/|title=Hear Justin Bieber Join the Kid Laroi on New Single 'Stay'|last=Zemler|first=Emily|date=9 July 2021|magazine=[[Rolling Stone]]|access-date=10 July 2021|archive-date=10 July 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210710071914/https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/justin-bieber-the-kid-laroi-stay-video-1194847/|url-status=live}}</ref>

